      <h1>Is Your Vibe-Coded App <em>Ready to Launch?</em></h1>
      <p class="dek">Apps built with Lovable, Bolt, Cursor, Claude Code, and Replit go from idea to live in a weekend. Whether they should go live is a different question. Here is what the evidence actually says about AI-built apps in production, three security tests anyone can run this afternoon, and a free way to score readiness before strangers find the app for you.</p>
